      "title": "Why The Thing is One of the Most Effective Horror Movies Ever Made",
      "snippet": "Every October, I revisit John Carpenter 's \"The Thing\" to celebrate the month of Halloween, and every year I arrive at the same conclusion: it's one of the most effective horror films ever made. I know every scene, line, and frame by heart, but this year, the experience felt different. Like the shapeshifting monster imitating life forms, everything about \"The Thing\" looked the same ...",
